      "project_id": "5e29e069-00ae-527b-a8b6-64bb6db68e46",
      "label": "Series",
      "body": "4 episodes, one scam each: fake job, lucky draw, investment and love scam. The message: scams prey on emotions, so pause.",
      "sort_order": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b3e8d112-6596-5e08-adbd-bf14da240436",
      "project_id": "5e29e069-00ae-527b-a8b6-64bb6db68e46",
